  "notes": [
    "A workspace strip now runs across the top of the Dashboard, above the",
    "sidebar and the main pane. Each tab is a place you have open (a",
    "repository, or none) and remembers its last view, so you can move",
    "between, say, alpha's Loop and beta's Docs without going back through",
    "Fleet. `+` opens a new workspace and × closes one; closing never changes",
    "the registry or a loop. Only the selected workspace is live, so a Loop",
    "you switch away from stops polling. Back undoes a tab switch. Arrow keys",
    "move between tabs and Enter selects. The selected tab is shown by bold"
  ],
